    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nywolirok pa Samson",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joisiraili jotimo reco kendo ruwaŋ Rwoth, aka Rwoth omiyo jo i cingi Jofilistia ma oro piero aŋwen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido nitie jacwo acel ma wok i Zora, janono pa Dan, nyinge obedo Manowa; aka cege oyido kinywol ongoye gi nyithindho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika pa Rwoth omenyere ri dhako no to waco rigo ni, “Neni, ikinywol aka ingoye gi nyithindho, t'ilagamo iyin t'inywolo wodin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo mondo gwokere, ikir'imadhi vini kosa medho makec, kosa icami gimakoc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.6.1+NUM.6.2+NUM.6.3+NUM.6.4+NUM.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwan 6:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ilagamo iyin t'inywol wodin. To ongoye kamweso geyo wiye, kole jayac labedo Janazir ri Were wok i nywolirok. Go ama lacako botho Isiraili wok i cingi Jofilistia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhako no obino to waco ri cwore ni, “Jacwo pa Were obino bongan, aka cal pere oyido bwoko jo paka malaika pa Were. Akipenjo go nike owok kune, aka go k'owaco ran nyinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To go owaco ran ni, ‘Panen, ilagamo iyin t'inywolo wodin, onyo ikir'imadhi vini kosa medho makec, kosa icami gimakoc, kole jayac labedo Janazir ri Were wok i nywolirok pere tundo tho pere.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa okwayo Rwoth ka waco ni, “Cwakan Rwoth, to weyi jacwo pa Were m'ioro wobin bongi wan kendo fonjo wan gima waripo timo ri jayac ma lanywole.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were owinjo dwondi Manowa, aka malaika pa Were obino kendo bongi dhako munyo go obedo i ndelo; to Manowa oyido ongoye bonge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhako oŋweco piyo aka owaco ri cwore ni, “Panen, jacwo m'obino bongan ceŋino oneno ran kendo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa oay malo aka oluwo cege, to bino bongi jacwo no aka openjo go ni, “Iŋat'ibedo jacwo m'oluwo gi dhako paran?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go odwoko ni, “Ey abedo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa openjo ni, “Ka wac perin otundi i kare, kwo pa jayac ripo bedo nedi, aka go latimo aŋo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika pa Rwoth odwoko Manowa ni, “Kwoŋ gim'atieko waco ri dhako je, go ripo kuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go kiripi camo gimoro je ma wok i yath vini, kosa madho vini, kosa medho makec, kosa camo gimakoc moro je. Go ripo kuro or m'amiyo go je.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa owaco ri malaika pa Rwoth ni, “Mondo weyi idoŋ gi wan, ŋey watedi rin nyathi diel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika pa Rwoth odwoko Manowa ni, “K'anodoŋ gi win, akilacamo cemo mewin, to ka wimito timo mic awaŋa, miy win ri Rwoth.” Kole Manowa oyido okuya nike go obedo malaika pa Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manowa openjo malaika pa Rwoth ni, “Nyingin ŋa, ŋey ka wac perin otundo i kare wanyal miyin dwoŋ?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika pa Rwoth openjo Manowa ni, “Raŋo ipenjo nyingan, ma kiniaŋere?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Manowa okwanyo nyathi diel kodi mic ma cemo, aka omiyo i wi tele ri Rwoth, gir'aura ma timere; aka Manowa kodi cege joŋiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo mac liel kadho malo i polo wok i wi migam, malaika pa Rwoth okadho malo i mac ma migam kareno Manowa kodi cege joŋiyo; aka jopodho piny gi nyim jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
